UID:foresight-ai-nodes-rfp-local-compute@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261024T212627Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Foresight Institute AI Nodes RFP\, Track I: Local Compute
DESCRIPTION:Track I of Foresight Institute's AI for Science & Safety Nodes 
 RFP funds building and scaling local compute setups that individuals or co
 mmunities physically own and control. With five companies holding 71 perce
 nt of the world's AI compute\, researchers relying on APIs and rented comp
 ute face data exposure\, steep price increases and the risk of losing acce
 ss altogether\; open models are ready for serious science and safety work\
 , but the ecosystem lacks sovereign and secure compute infrastructure. LOO
 KING FOR: local compute clusters in different sizes and configurations tha
 t are easy to set up and run across varied connectivity and electricity en
 vironments\; blueprints for easy yet secure cluster management\; models fo
 r bringing down cost\, like selling idle compute or connecting to communit
 y clusters\; ideally a business case for building\, selling and distributi
 ng such clusters at scale. EXAMPLE DELIVERABLES: a prototype AI cluster an
  average person can deploy at home\, software that runs a node without exp
 ert knowledge\, economic models showing how the hardware pays for itself\,
  a pilot deployment for individuals or communities. Selected projects rece
 ive grant funding\, private local compute\, workspace at the San Francisco
  or Berlin AI Nodes\, travel-paid field-building events and access to Fore
 sight's advisors and network\; in-person contributors at the Nodes are str
 ongly prioritised. Individuals\, teams\, and nonprofit or for-profit organ
 isations worldwide may apply (for-profits must justify their need for gran
 t funding). Deadline 31 October 2026\, 23:59 PDT.\n\nOrganisation: Foresig
 ht Institute\nLocation: Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and Berlin)
 \nAward: Typically $30\,000 to $100\,000 per grant (larger possible for th
 e right project)\, plus private local compute and workspace at the San Fra
 ncisco or Berlin AI Nodes. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based\n\
 nMore: https://foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp-local-comp
 ute/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp-local-compute/
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and Berlin)
END:VEVENT
